{"word":"ἀπορία","uri":"aporia","senses":[{"word":"ἀπορία","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἀπορία,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ας</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>)\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> difficulté de passer,\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 6, 10</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> manque de ressources,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> manque, privation,\n<span class=\"ital\">en gén.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Att.</span> : <span class=\"grec\">τροφῆς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 11,</span>\nmanque de nourriture ; <span class=\"grec\">ἀπώλλυντο ἀπορίᾳ τοῦ\nθεραπεύοντος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 51,</span> ils périssaient faute de qqn pour les soigner\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">abs.</span> besoin, indigence, pauvreté, <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 123,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">εὐπορία,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 8, 4 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">πενία,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">And.</span> <span class=\"refch\">18, 42 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">au plur.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">386, 15</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> embarras,\ndifficulté : <span class=\"grec\">ἐς ἀπορίην</span>\n(<span class=\"ital\">ion.</span>) <span class=\"grec\">πολλὴν\nἀπιγμένος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 79,</span> réduit à un extrême embarras ; <span class=\"grec\">ἀπορίῃσιν ἐνέχεσθαι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\"